		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2AE8C3E08A66EBE4"]
			description: [
				"The webs are not decoration. Something has been breeding in the roots of our cities for a very long time."
				""
				"Kill ten of them. Then look at what you killed — they are fat, and they are not hungry. Ask yourself what they have been eating."
			]
