		{
			dependencies: ["29569136F0E03D89"]
			description: [
				"Find seed. Any seed. Put it in ground you have turned with your own hands and watch whether it comes up."
				""
				"You will spend ten eras learning to make plants do industrial work. It begins with proving that a plant will still grow here at all."
			]
