		{
			dependencies: ["7E0585FFA89CAB1F"]
			description: [
				"This is not a weapon and it is not a tool. It is a way of looking."
				""
				"Point it at anything botanical and it will tell you what that thing is doing. Most of what you need to learn in the next ten eras, you will learn by pointing this at something and paying attention."
			]
			id: "143A8FA512B4B987"
