		{
			dependencies: ["143A8FA512B4B987"]
			description: [
				"Mana does not travel on its own. Something must throw it."
				""
				"Build the frame from Dreamwood. It will want a little copper too — we are not so proud that we refuse a good conductor."
				""
				"There is a finer pattern, worked in Elementium, that throws further and truer. You cannot make it yet. Elementium is a thing you dig out of Alfheim, and you have not learned where to dig."
			]
			id: "2CF07512DAB3AAF3"
