			title: "How This Book Works"
			x: 10.5d
			y: -6.5d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"Before you take anything out of this grove, measure what is in it."
				""
				"The Eye is glass and gold fibre and it shows you the aura of the chunk you stand in. Carry it. Look often. You are about to learn that the Ashen Grove is not poor by metaphor."
			]
			id: "72D6866D212442BD"
