		{
			description: [
				"Now put it in the fire."
				""
				"Not before. A raw bloom in a furnace gives you nothing and teaches you nothing; a quickened one gives up what it has been holding."
				""
				"There is no coal seam in Alfheim. There is no iron vein. Every scrap of metal on this side of the gate came out of a flower that someone steeped first - and now you have done the whole of it yourself, from a coloured stain in the rock to a useful thing in your hand."
			]
